# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Cloud Functions compiled output — built from functions/src by `tsc` in
# functions/package.json's `build` script. Firebase Functions deploy runs
# `npm run build` automatically, so the compiled lib/ doesn't need to be
# committed and committing it produces noisy diffs on every backend change.
functions/lib/

